{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Molecular.ElectronShellCapacity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Molecular.ElectronShellCapacity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Nat.Defs"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.ElectronShellCapacity.electron_shell_capacity_2n2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.ElectronShellCapacity.electron_shell_capacity_2n2","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ElectronShellCapacity.lean#L36-L43","doc":"**The `2n²` shell-capacity rule.**\n\n`electron_shell_capacity_2n2 capacity` holds when `capacity n = 2n²` for\nevery shell index `n`. A predicate on the capacity function, not an\nexistential over it — the existential form is discharged by\n`fun k => 2 * k ^ 2` and therefore asserts nothing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}